@startuml
title 3.6.14 Calculate verification confidence
caption UC-110 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: apps/api-node/src/migrations/002_lost_found_schema.sql
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "System" as Actor
participant "Proposed Verification Task" as Page
participant "Claim Service" as Service
participant "claims" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Calculate support confidence (proposed task)
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Table: 3: Proposed: read authorized answer/evidence support signals
activate Table
Table --> Service: 4: Verification input snapshot
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 5: Calculate explainable support score with versioned policy
Service -> Service: 6: Return confidence and uncertainty; require human decision
Service --> Page: 7: Support confidence only
Page --> Actor: 8: Record task outcome
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Planned: current answered-count progress is not this confidence algorithm. No active scoring
workflow or automatic ownership decision exists.
endlegend
@enduml
